@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — End a tour and show the Podium
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Child" as child
box "Frontend — game application" #E0F2FE
  participant "SoloGame\n(GameSession)" as solo
  participant "WorldMapPage" as map
  participant "PodiumPage" as page
end box
box "Frontend — components library" #E0F2FE
  participant "Podium,\nPassport" as views
end box
box "Frontend — domain library" #E0F2FE
  participant "Tour" as tour
  participant "Standings" as standings
  participant "Passport" as passport
  participant "GameClock" as clock
end box
solo -> clock : now()
clock --> solo : Game time
solo -> tour : applyDuel(winner, now)
solo -> tour : ending(now)
alt a player's distance travelled equals the tour length (L2-006 criteria 1 and 5)
  tour --> solo : allTheWayRound
else the time limit has passed (L2-006 criterion 2)
  tour --> solo : timeLimit
end
note over solo, tour : When neither has happened ending() is null and the next duel starts instead.
solo --> map : TourState phase over, the last move
map --> child : The last move and its message (L2-034 criterion 9)
alt the message has stayed 1.6 seconds on the game's clock
  clock -> solo : finish()
else the child chooses "Back to the card"
  map -> solo : continue()
end
solo -> tour : result(ending, you, one of the five kids)
tour -> standings : ordered()
standings --> tour : Every player 1st to last by distance, equal distance\nby who reached it first (L2-006 criteria 3, 4 and 6)
tour -> passport : pages(countries)
passport --> tour : A stamp or a placeholder for each country
tour --> solo : TourResult
solo --> page : GameSession.result, screen podium (L2-030 criterion 5)
page -> views : Headline, cheer, top three, passport, count and place\n(L2-035 criteria 1, 2, 5 and 7)
views --> child : The places rise third, second, first (L2-038 criterion 6)
views --> child : The Podium
@enduml
